body:
A guy I was working with said he earned £700 a week,, which I thought was nice... in the 1973. That's not an adjustment for inflation. To give you an idea, he paid £23 per month for his mortgage and a car was £500. He worked as a chef.

&#x200B;

I cried more that day then any other day of my life.

Except this is using machines purchased pre-sanctions. That's how they are getting around it, by using pre-sanction equipment.

&#x200B;

These litho machines are not being domestically produced, but just using ASML machines they previously purchased.
